<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head>
  <title>About the OPCL</title>
  
  <%- include("partials/metadata") %>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css"></head> <body>
  <%- include("partials/header") %>



<main>
  <section class="about-section">
    <div class="about-inner">
      <h1 class="about-title order-title">Praecones Leonis Campanaeque Solis</h1>
      <hr class="order-rule">

      <p class="about-text">
        The Order of the Lion's Bell was founded as a philosophical and chivalric fellowship devoted to awakening, the pursuit of knowledge, and the proclamation of truth.
      </p>

      <div class="divider-symbol">✶✶</div>

      <p class="about-text">
        The Order draws inspiration from mystical philosophy, ancient cosmology, hermetic traditions, gnostic thought, and the symbolic teachings of the mystery schools.
      </p>


      <div class="divider-symbol">✶✶</div>

      <p class="about-text">
        Rather than claiming a single religious authority, the Order studies these traditions as symbolic paths toward a deeper understanding of reality and truth.
      </p>


      <div class="divider-symbol">✶✶</div>

      <p class="about-text">
        Members of the Order are known as <span class="accent">Heralds of the Lion</span>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>









